{
  "dashboard": {
    "title": "L2 — 用户主页、联系人和关系商用健康度",
    "uid": "qwq-l2-relationship-commercial",
    "tags": ["quwoquan", "l2", "user", "relationship", "contact", "commercial"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "refresh": "30s",
    "panels": [
      {
        "title": "关注 / 拉黑命令结果",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{service=\"user-service\",route=~\"/user/sub-accounts/.*/(follow|block)\"}[5m])) by (route, method, status)",
            "legendFormat": "{{ method }} {{ route }} {{ status }}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "关系对象命令 / 列表 / 计数投影 P95",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(quwoquan_persona_relationship_command_latency_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "command P95"
          },
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(quwoquan_persona_relationship_list_latency_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "list P95"
          },
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(quwoquan_persona_relationship_counter_projection_lag_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "counter projection lag P95"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "添加联系人有效成功率（服务代理指标）",
        "description": "2xx FollowUser / 全部 FollowUser。互关形成率必须由 SLS product_action + capability relationState 对账，不能从本面板推断。",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{service=\"user-service\",method=\"POST\",route=~\"/user/sub-accounts/.*/follow\",status=~\"2..\"}[10m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{service=\"user-service\",method=\"POST\",route=~\"/user/sub-accounts/.*/follow\"}[10m])), 0.001)",
            "legendFormat": "follow success ratio"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "打招呼请求与升级结果",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{service=\"user-service\",route=~\"/user/greeting-request.*\"}[5m])) by (route, method, status)",
            "legendFormat": "{{ method }} {{ route }} {{ status }}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "通讯录发现 / 关注对象读链路",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{service=\"user-service\",route=~\"/owner/contact-discovery.*|/user/following-subjects|/user/followed-subjects/.*\"}[5m])) by (route, status)",
            "legendFormat": "{{ route }} {{ status }}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "关系域错误码",
        "type": "table",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "topk(30, sum(increase(http_server_error_codes_total{service=\"user-service\",module=\"USER\",kind=~\"RELATIONSHIP|GREETING|CONTACT|SUBJECT_FOLLOW\"}[1h])) by (error_code, kind))",
            "format": "table",
            "instant": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "主页公开读取 / 分身切换 P95",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(quwoquan_profile_subject_public_read_latency_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "profile read P95"
          },
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(quwoquan_persona_switch_latency_ms_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "persona switch P95"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "关系 / 主页对象一致性异常",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(quwoquan_persona_relationship_events_total[1h])) by (metric)",
            "legendFormat": "relationship {{ metric }}"
          },
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(quwoquan_profile_subject_events_total[1h])) by (metric)",
            "legendFormat": "profile {{ metric }}"
          },
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(quwoquan_persona_rollout_events_total[1h])) by (metric)",
            "legendFormat": "persona {{ metric }}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "黄金指标与事实边界",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "业务黄金指标以 SLS `product_action` 为事实源：`follow_contact_*` 有效添加率、follow→mutual 互关形成率、GreetingRequest send→reply 回复率、显式 `summaryIntersections` 展示→`open_contact` 有效行动率。Prometheus 面板只表示服务健康，禁止把请求量或推荐分数冒充关系/交集事实。"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
